,"بَيْتُكُمْ","tum logon ka ghar","فِي بَيْتِكُمْ","tum logon ke ghar mein"],["Misaal 2","رَبُّكُمْ","tum logon ka Rabb","إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُمْ","tum logon ke Rabb ki taraf"],["Misaal 3","رَسُولُكُمْ","tum logon ka rasool","مِنْ رَسُولِكُمْ","tum logon ke rasool se"]]}},{"type":"rule_paragraph","text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0 18px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 236\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:800px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"hdrGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#047857\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"800\" height=\"58\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <rect y=\"42\" width=\"800\" height=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Unit 5 • Sabaq 11 (Page 72): Harf-e-Jarr + Ism + ـكُمْ (فِي كِتَابِكُمْ)</text>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"46\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#ccfbf1\">كِتَابُكُمْ (tumhari kitaab) ← فِي كِتَابِكُمْ (tumhari kitaab mein)</text>\n  <rect x=\"18\" y=\"14\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.18)\"/>\n  <text x=\"73\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">S5L11 • Pages 72–73</text>\n  \n        <g transform=\"translate(20, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ecfdf5\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">بَيْتُكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#059669\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#059669\" direction=\"rtl\">فِي بَيْتِكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">tumhara ghar → tumhare ghar mein</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Fii / Min / Alaa + ـِكُمْ</text>\n        </g>\n        <g transform=\"translate(280, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f0f9ff\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">رَبُّكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\" direction=\"rtl\">إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">tumhara Rabb → tumhare Rabb ki taraf</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">كُمْ se pehle harf ke neeche zer</text>\n        </g>\n        <g transform=\"translate(540, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f5f3ff\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">رَبُّكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" direction=\"rtl\">إِنَّ رَبَّكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">tumhara Rabb → beshak tumhara Rabb</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Inna se كُمْ se pehle harf par zabar</text>\n        </g>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"202\" width=\"740\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#334155\">Qaa'ida: Harf-e-Jarr aane se (ـكُمْ) se pehle waale harf ke neeche zer aati hai, aur (إِنَّ) aane se zabar aata hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>Aap jaante hain ke kisi lafz ke aakhir mein (كُمْ) ho to us mein 'tumhara' ya 'tumhari' ka mafhoom aa jaata hai. Aise alfaaz ke shuru mein (فِي، مِنْ، إِلَىٰ، عَلَىٰ، لِـ، بِـ) aane se (كُمْ) se pehle waale lafz ke neeche zer aa jaati hai:","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0 18px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 236\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:800px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"hdrGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#047857\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"800\" height=\"58\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <rect y=\"42\" width=\"800\" height=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Unit 5 • Sabaq 11 (Page 72): Harf-e-Jarr + Ism + ـكُمْ (فِي كِتَابِكُمْ)</text>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"46\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#ccfbf1\">كِتَابُكُمْ (tumhari kitaab) ← فِي كِتَابِكُمْ (tumhari kitaab mein)</text>\n  <rect x=\"18\" y=\"14\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.18)\"/>\n  <text x=\"73\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">S5L11 • Pages 72–73</text>\n  \n        <g transform=\"translate(20, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ecfdf5\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">بَيْتُكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#059669\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#059669\" direction=\"rtl\">فِي بَيْتِكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">tumhara ghar → tumhare ghar mein</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Fii / Min / Alaa + ـِكُمْ</text>\n        </g>\n        <g transform=\"translate(280, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f0f9ff\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">رَبُّكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\" direction=\"rtl\">إِلَىٰ رَبِّكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">tumhara Rabb → tumhare Rabb ki taraf</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">كُمْ se pehle harf ke neeche zer</text>\n        </g>\n        <g transform=\"translate(540, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f5f3ff\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">رَبُّكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" direction=\"rtl\">إِنَّ رَبَّكُمْ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">tumhara Rabb → beshak tumhara Rabb</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Inna se كُمْ se pehle harf par zabar</text>\n        </g>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"202\" width=\"740\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#334155\">Qaa'ida: Harf-e-Jarr aane se (ـكُمْ) se pehle waale harf ke neeche zer aati hai, aur (إِنَّ) aane se zabar aata hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>Aap jaante hain ke kisi lafz ke aakhir mein (كُمْ) ho to us mein 'tumhara' ya 'tumhari' ka mafhoom aa jaata hai. Aise alfaaz ke shuru mein (فِي، مِنْ، إِلَىٰ، عَلَىٰ، لِـ، بِـ) aane se (كُمْ) se pehle waale lafz ke neeche zer aa jaati hai:"}},{"type":"rule_paragraph","text":"(كُمْ) ki taraf mansoob darj-e-zail alfaaz ke shuru mein (عَلَىٰ) aaya hai. Inka tarjuma kijiye, jaise عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِكُمْ : tum logon ke dilon par:","data":{"text":"(كُمْ) ki taraf mansoob darj-e-zail alfaaz ke shuru mein (عَلَىٰ) aaya hai. Inka tarjuma kijiye, jaise عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِكُمْ : tum logon ke dilon par:"}},{"type":"section_label","text":"1. Shuru mein (عَلَىٰ) waale Qur'ani Qat'aat (6 Items — Left to Right)","data":{"text":"1. Shuru mein (عَلَىٰ) waale Qur'ani Qat'aat (6 Items — Left to Right)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","is_numbered":false,"data":{"items":[{"id":"s5l11_alaa_1","arabic":"عَلَى إِخْرَاجِكُمْ","hinglish":"tum logon ke nikalne par","translations":{"en":"Upon driving you out","ur":"تمہیں نکال باہر کرنے پر","hi":"तुम्हें निकालने पर"},"arabic_markup":"عَلَى <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِخْرَاجِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُمْ</span>","displayOrder":1},{"id":"s5l11_alaa_2","arabic":"عَلَى أَنْفُسِكُمْ","hinglish":"tum logon ki janon par","translations":{"en":"Upon yourselves","ur":"تمہاری جانوں پر","hi":"तुम्हारी जानों पर"},"arabic_markup":"عَلَى <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَنْفُسِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُمْ</span>","displayOrder":2},{"id":"s5l11_alaa_3","arabic":"عَلَى قُلُوبِكُمْ","hinglish":"tum logon ke dilo