c_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَسُولَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>"},{"id":"s5l11_inna_3","arabic":"إِنَّ إِلَهَكُم","hinglish":"beshak tumhara mabood","translations":{"en":"Indeed, your God","ur":"بیشک تمہارا معبود","hi":"निःसंदेह तुम्हारा पूज्य"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَهَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>"},{"id":"s5l11_inna_4","arabic":"إِنَّ سَعْيَكُم","hinglish":"beshak tumhari koshish","translations":{"en":"Indeed, your effort","ur":"بیشک تمہاری کوشش","hi":"निःसंदेह तुम्हारी कोशिश"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَعْيَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>"},{"id":"s5l11_inna_5","arabic":"إِنَّ أَكْرَمَكُم","hinglish":"beshak tum mein sab se muazzaz","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the most noble of you","ur":"بیشک تم میں سب سے عزت والا","hi":"निःसंदेह तुम में सबसे अधिक सम्मानित"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَكْرَمَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>"}],"is_numbered":false}},{"type":"section_label","text":"6. Qur'ani Jumle aur Aayaat — Page 73 (Numbered 1–15)","data":{"text":"6. Qur'ani Jumle aur Aayaat — Page 73 (Numbered 1–15)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","is_numbered":true,"data":{"items":[{"id":"s5l11_s_1","arabic":"إِنَّ رَبَّكُمُ اللَّهُ","hinglish":"beshak tumhara Rabb Allah Hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, your Lord is Allah","ur":"بیشک تمہارا رب اللہ ہے","hi":"निःसंदेह तुम्हारा रब अल्लाह है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبَّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُمُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ</span>","sentence_number":1},{"id":"s5l11_s_2","arabic":"وَإِنَّ رَبَّكُمُ الرَّحْمَنُ","hinglish":"aur beshak tumhara Rabb Rahman Hai","translations":{"en":"And indeed, your Lord is the Most Merciful","ur":"اور بیشک تمہارا رب رحمن ہے","hi":"और वास्तव में तुम्हारा रब रहमान (अत्यंत दयावान) है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبَّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُمُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">الرَّحْمَنُ</span>","sentence_number":2,"ref":"20:90"},{"id":"s5l11_s_3","arabic":"إِنَّ إِلَهَكُم لَوَاحِدٌ","hinglish":"beshak tumhara mabood ek hi hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, your God is surely One","ur":"بیشک تمہارا معبود یقیناً ایک ہی ہے","hi":"निःसंदेह तुम्हारा पूज्य निश्चित ही एक है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَهَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَوَاحِدٌ</span>","sentence_number":3,"ref":"37:4"},{"id":"s5l11_s_4","arabic":"وَاللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِإِيمَانِكُم","hinglish":"aur Allah tumhare imaan ko zyada jaanne wala Hai","translations":{"en":"And Allah is most knowing of your faith","ur":"اور اللہ تمہارے ایمان کو خوب جاننے والا ہے","hi":"और अल्लाह तुम्हारे ईमान को भली-भांति जानने वाला है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">إِيمَانِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>","sentence_number":4,"ref":"4:25"},{"id":"s5l11_s_5","arabic":"إِنَّ رَبَّكُم لَرَءُوفٌ رَحِيمٌ","hinglish":"beshak tumhara Rabb bada shafqat karne wala meharban Hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, your Lord is Kind and Merciful","ur":"بیشک تمہارا رب بڑا شفقت کرنے والا نہایت رحم والا ہے","hi":"निःसंदेह तुम्हारा रब अत्यंत कृपालु और दयावान है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبَّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَرَءُوفٌ رَحِيمٌ</span>","sentence_number":5,"ref":"16:7"},{"id":"s5l11_s_6","arabic":"إِنَّ سَعْيَكُم لَشَتَّى","hinglish":"beshak tumhari koshish juda juda hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, your efforts are diverse","ur":"بیشک تمہاری کوششیں مختلف (جدا جدا) ہیں","hi":"निःसंदेह तुम्हारे प्रयास भिन्न-भिन्न हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">سَعْيَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَشَتَّى</span>","sentence_number":6,"ref":"92:4"},{"id":"s5l11_s_7","arabic":"وَاللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِأَعْدَائِكُم","hinglish":"aur Allah tumhare dushmanon ko zyada jaanne wala Hai","translations":{"en":"And Allah is most knowing of your enemies","ur":"اور اللہ تمہارے دشمنوں کو خوب جاننے والا ہے","hi":"और अल्लाह तुम्हारे दुश्मनों को भली-भांति जानने वाला है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَاللَّهُ أَعْلَمُ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">بِ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">أَعْدَائِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>","sentence_number":7,"ref":"4:45"},{"id":"s5l11_s_8","arabic":"رَبُّكُمْ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا فِي نُفُوسِكُمْ","hinglish":"Tumhara Rabb khoob jaanne waala hai jo kuchh tumhare dilon mein hai","translations":{"en":"Your Lord is most knowing of what is within yourselves","ur":"تمہارا رب خوب جانتا ہے جو کچھ تمہارے دلوں (نفسوں) میں ہے","hi":"तुम्हारा रब भली-भांति जानता है जो कुछ तुम्हारे मनों (नफ़्स) में है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبُّكُمْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">أَعْلَمُ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بِمَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فِي</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نُفُوسِكُمْ</span>","sentence_number":8,"ref":"17:25"},{"id":"s5l11_s_9","arabic":"فِيهِ سَكِينَةٌ مِن رَبِّكُم","hinglish":"us mein sukoon hai tumhare Rabb ki taraf se","translations":{"en":"In it is tranquility from your Lord","ur":"اس میں تمہارے رب کی طرف سے سکینت (تسکین) ہے","hi":"उसमें तुम्हारे रब की ओर से तसल्ली (सकीना) है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فِيهِ سَكِينَةٌ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">مِن</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>","sentence_number":9,"ref":"2:248"},{"id":"s5l11_s_10","arabic":"ثُمَّ إِلَى رَبِّكُم مَرْجِعُكُم","hinglish":"phir tumhare Rabb ki taraf tumhara lautna hai","translations":{"en":"Then to your Lord is your return","ur":"پھر تمہارے رب ہی کی طرف تمہارا پلٹنا ہے","hi":"फिर तुम्हारे रब ही की ओर तुम्हारा लौटना है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ثُمَّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَرْجِعُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>","sentence_number":10,"ref":"6:164"},{"id":"s5l11_s_11","arabic":"فَإِنَّ مَصِيرَكُم إِلَى النَّارِ","hinglish":"toh beshak tumhara thikana aag ki taraf hai","translations":{"en":"Then indeed, your destination is the Fire","ur":"تو بیشک تمہارا ٹھکانہ آگ کی طرف ہے","hi":"तो निःसंदेह तुम्हारा ठिकाना आग की ओर है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">فَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مَصِيرَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَى النَّارِ</span>","sentence_number":11,"ref":"14:30"},{"id":"s5l11_s_12","arabic":"وَأَنَّ أَكْثَرَكُم فَاسِقُونَ","hinglish":"aur beshak tum mein se aksar naafarman hain","translations":{"en":"And that most of you are defiantly disobedient","ur":"اور یہ کہ تم میں سے اکثر نافرمان ہیں","hi":"और यह कि तुममें से अधिकतर नाफ़रमान (फासिक़) हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَكْثَرَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">فَاسِقُونَ</span>","sentence_number":12,"ref":"5:59"},{"id":"s5l11_s_13","arabic":"إِنَّمَا بَغْيُكُم عَلَى أَنْفُسِكُم","hinglish":"bas tumhari sarkashi tumhari apni jaanon par hai","translations":{"en":"Your rebellion is only against yourselves","ur":"تمہاری سرکشی تو خود تمہاری ہی جانوں کے خلاف ہے","hi":"तुम्हारी सरकशी तो स्वयं तुम्हारी ही जानों पर भारी है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّمَا بَغْيُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَنْفُسِ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>","sentence_number":13,"ref":"10:23"},{"id":"s5l11_s_14","arabic":"الْحَقُّ مِن رَبِّكُم","hinglish":"haq tumhare Rabb ki taraf se hai","translations":{"en":"The truth is from your Lord","ur":"حق تمہارے رب کی طرف سے ہے","hi":"सत्य तुम्हारे रब की ओर से है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">الْحَقُّ </span><span class=\"nonroot\">مِن</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبِّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span>","sentence_number":14},{"id":"s5l11_s_15","arabic":"إِنَّ أَكْرَمَكُم عِنْدَ اللَّهِ أَتْقَاكُم إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ خَبِيرٌ","hinglish":"beshak Allah ke paas tum mein sab se muazzaz zyada parhezgar hai beshak Allah jaanne wala khabardar Hai","translations":{"en":"Indeed, the most noble of you in the sight of Allah is the most righteous of you. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Aware","ur":"بیشک اللہ کے نزدیک تم میں سب سے زیادہ عزت والا وہ ہے جو تم میں سب سے زیادہ پرہیزگار ہے، بیشک اللہ سب جاننے والا باخبر ہے","hi":"निःसंदेह अल्लाह के यहाँ तुममें सबसे अधिक सम्मानित वह है जो तुममें सबसे अधिक परहेज़गार है, वास्तव में अल्लाह सब जानने वाला, ख़बर रखने वाला है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَكْرَمَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِنْدَ اللَّهِ أَتْقَا</span><span class=\"nonroot\">كُم</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّ اللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ خَبِيرٌ</span>","sentence_number":15,"ref":"49:13"}],"is_numbered":true}}]}}